// # ooredact package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for ooredact (layers/L3-tools).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (ooredact.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of ooredact.oo.
